[b]RGO Harmony Expanded[/b]

A standalone RGO Harmony profile for:
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3692202776]Community Mod Framework[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3809335454]More locations Mod[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3602513956]Historical RGOs - Global[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3785316314]Just Goods[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3821883489]Fruits Expanded[/url]
[/list]

Load the required mods in this order, with RGO Harmony Expanded last:
[list=1]
[*]Community Mod Framework
[*]More locations Mod
[*]Historical RGOs - Global
[*]Just Goods
[*]Fruits Expanded
[*]RGO Harmony Expanded
[/list]

Expanded keeps the complete RGO Harmony / More Locations map as its base. It applies Fruits Expanded values at 949 locations where Harmony matches Vanilla and Fruits Expanded changes the RGO, plus all 67 locations where Vanilla, Harmony, and Fruits Expanded differ. The 1,088 approved Harmony values remain unchanged.

The 71 locations where Harmony uses generic [i]fruit[/i] remain flagged for fruit-replacement review; none is silently assigned. The six Fruits Expanded omissions and More Locations-only locations retain the base Harmony map behavior. Just Goods fixed-location effects remain authoritative.

The downloaded Fruits Expanded / Just Goods compatibility patch is not included. Its current effect replacements omit Just Goods 1.1 locations and restore the obsolete turmeric assignment at chan_bo. It must be updated before it can be used with this profile.
